        F8A@{ label: "Micro-celebration: Week completion celebration + progress milestone badge"}
        F9["Automatically redirects back to the main /workouts/plans page"]
        F10["'Current Week' section now says 'Current Week: Week 2' and all Week 2 daily workout cards appear"]
        F10A@{ label: "Progress visualization: Overall program progress bar updated with week completion"}
        F11["In 'Logged Workouts' section, instead of showing the individual logged workout cards under 'Week 1', 'Week 1' becomes clickable & collapsible with a small 'Completed' icon next to it **AND** a 'Request Week 1 Feedback' button"]
        F12["Message appears temporarily at bottom of screen saying (Successfully completed and logged workout. You can view this workout log under 'Logged Workouts')"]      
        F13["After 1st message disappears, another message appears temporarily at bottom of screen saying (All Week 1 workouts have been successfully completed and logged. You can view the completed workouts under 'Logged Workouts')"]
