        F15["Week 1 daily workout cards then appear and each has a 'View Workout Log' button"]
        F16["User clicks on 'View Workout Log' button for any of the completed workouts and that daily workout's details and logged data fill the screen for user review"]
        F17["'Close Logged Workout' button appears at top-right & bottom-right of page/screen"]
        F18["User clicks either of these buttons"]
        F19["Main /workouts/plans page display"]
        F20["User clicks 'Request Week 1 Feedback' button"]
        F21["Makes API call to agent"]
        F22["Agent retrieves all data for all logged Week 1 daily workouts from database"]
        F23["Agent reviews and analyzes all Week 1 data"]
        F24["Agent reasons and thinks to consider what insights can be derived from data"]
        F25["Agent considers what went well and what could use improvement"]
        F26["Agent considers how to apply insights and data to be usable for user in Week 2"]
        F27["Agent's insights output is displayed in a chat box and asks user if they'd like agent to save information to memory **AND** apply any actionable insights to Week 2 daily workouts"]
        F28["Only save to memory?"]
        F29["Save to memory & apply actionable insights to Week 2?"]
        F30["Feedback and insights are stored in database for user"]
        F31["Dropdown list appears"]
        F32["User selects 'Save to memory, and apply insights'"]
        F33["User selects 'Save to memory, but don't apply insights"]
        F34["Feedback and insights are stored in database for user"]
        F35["Makes API call"]
        F36["Agent retrieves Week 2 daily workouts and details and considers how actionable insights from week 1 can be applied"]
        F37["Upon success, agent briefly and concisely summarizes how the actionable insights were applied to Week 2 daily workouts"]
        F38["'Apply Changes' and 'Discard Changes' buttons appear"]
        F39["Apply Changes?"]
        F40["User clicks 'Apply Changes' and updates to Week 2 Daily workouts are saved to database"]
        F41["User clicks 'Discard Changes' and updates to Week 2 Daily workouts are not saved and Week 2 Daily workouts remain as they were"]
        F42["Page reloads"]
        F43["Main /workouts/plans page display"]
        F44["'Current Week: Week 2' section correctly displays updated daily workouts with actionable insights from Week 1 applied"]
        F45["'Current Week: Week 2' section still displays daily workouts as they were without actionable insights from Week 1 applied"]
        F46["Page reloads"]
        F47["Chat interface appears showing agent progression"]
        F48["Cycle below repeats for completion of additional weeks"]

  end
subgraph six["Preview Future Weeks in Mesocycle"]
        G1["Logic & Display of Future Weeks in Mesocycle - current week set to week 1 in example"]
