  end
subgraph seven["Daily Workout Plan Adjustments"]
        H1["Process & logic for when users want to adjust daily workouts"]
        H2["All individual daily workout cards contain a 'Edit Workout' button"]
        H3["User clicks 'Edit Workout' button for specific daily workout"]
        H4["Page reloads"]
        H5["Now page displays specific daily workout details with a chat box at the top and heading - 'What would you like to adjust?'"]
        H6["Chat box is pre-filled with a message & example adjustments"]
        H7["Message: 'Make adjustment requests specific and concise (400 character limit)'"]
        H8["Example adjustments: 'Too many/too few exercises, use rep ranges instead of reps, don't have a specific piece of equipment - substitute exercise for X, etc.'"]
        H9["User inputs specific and concise adjustment requests"]
        H10["User clicks 'Request Adjustments' button"]
        H11["Agent compares requested adjustments to the current daily workout details stored"]
        H12["Agent reasons and considers most optimal way to make adjustments within the context of the program and workout data and the user's preferences, goals, and measurements"]
        H13["Agent's output is displayed in the chat (output should be specific and concise, 750 character limit)"]
        H14["User reviews agent's output"]
        H15["Are adjustments sufficient?"]
        H16["User clicks 'Confirm Adjustments' button"]
        H17["Adjustments are saved to the database, updating the existing workout plan accordingly"]
        H18["Page reloads"]
        H19["Main /workouts/plans page is displayed"]
        H20["The daily workout that user requested and confirmed adjustments for should now be displayed reflecting the adjustments made"]
        H21["Limit adjustment requests to 3 per daily workout"]
  end
subgraph eight["Process & flow of mesocycle completion, feedback & insights, and generation of next mesocycle"]
        I1["Upon successful logging and saving of last daily workout of last week of current mesocycle, success message temporarily appears noting successful logging of workout"]
        I2["Once 1st message disappears, another message appears saying, (All weeks & daily workouts for this mesocycle have been completed and logged! You can now view all completed workouts under 'Logged Workouts' and request feedback and insights for this mesocycle)"]
        I3["This message contains a 'Continue' button, as well"]
        I4["User must click 'Continue' to clear this message"]
        I5["Page reloads"]
        I6["'Current Week: Week X' section/sub-heading changes to 'Mesocycle Completed: All Daily Workouts Logged'"]
        I7["Below the new section/sub-heading is the 'Request Mesocycle Feedback' button"]
        I8["User clicks 'Request Mesocycle Feedback' button"]
        I9["Page Reloads"]
        I10["Makes API call to agent"]
        I11["Chat interface appears showing agent progression"]
        I12["Agent retrieves all data for all logged daily workouts in the mesocycle from the database"]
        I13["Agent reviews and analyzes all saved mesocycle data"]
        I14["Agent considers what went well and what could use improvement"]
        I15["Agent considers how the insights and data related to this mesocycle may be used to optimize next mesocycle for user"]
        I16["Agent's brief & concise feedback and insights output is displayed in a chat box"]
        I17["Agent's brief & concise feedback and insights output is saved to database for user"]
        I18["Success message temporarily appears once the output is verified as saved in the database"]
        I19["A 'Proceed to Generate Next Mesocycle' button appears"]
        I20["User clicks 'Proceed to Generate Next Mesocycle' button"]
        I21["/workouts page"]
        
  end
